# BrainGrid Requirement Workflow

- **Plan first**: Review the REQ, outline tasks, and surface clarifying questions with the team before coding.
- **Confirm status**: When implementation starts, switch the BrainGrid REQ status to `IN_PROGRESS`.
- **Work transparently**: Commit related code regularly and keep the associated BrainGrid tasks updated as progress is made.
- **Close the loop**: After all work is complete, move the REQ into `REVIEW` and highlight anything that still needs attention.
